BT /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 50 790 Td (Acme Rockets - Customer Handbook) Tj T* () Tj T* (About Acme) Tj T* (Acme Rockets was founded in 2009 in Tucson, Arizona by Wile E. Coyote. The company designs) Tj T* (reusable model rockets for hobbyists, schools and research teams. Acme employs 48 people) Tj T* (and ships to 31 countries.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Products) Tj T* (The Roadrunner 1 is our entry-level rocket. It reaches an altitude of 300 metres, weighs) Tj T* (450 grams and costs $79.) Tj T* (The Mesa X is our mid-range rocket with a two-stage design. It reaches 1,200 metres,) Tj T* (includes a GPS recovery beacon and costs $249.) Tj T* (The Canyon Pro is our flagship research rocket. It reaches 3,000 metres, carries payloads) Tj T* (up to 500 grams, includes telemetry streaming and costs $899.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Shipping and Returns) Tj T* (Standard shipping takes 5-7 business days and is free on orders over $150. Express) Tj T* (shipping takes 2 business days and costs $25.) Tj T* (Products can be returned within 30 days if unused. Rockets that have been launched can) Tj T* (only be returned if they arrived defective. Refunds are processed within 5 business days) Tj T* (of receiving the return.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Warranty) Tj T* (All rockets carry a 1-year limited warranty covering manufacturing defects. The Canyon Pro) Tj T* (carries an extended 3-year warranty. The warranty does not cover crash damage, water) Tj T* (damage, or modifications.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Education Programme) Tj T* (Schools receive a 20% discount on orders of 10 or more rockets. Teachers can request a) Tj T* (free curriculum pack with 12 lesson plans covering aerodynamics, Newton's laws and data) Tj T* (analysis.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Support) Tj T* (Support is available Monday to Friday, 8am-6pm Mountain Time, via) Tj T* (support@acme-rockets.example or +1 520 555 0199. Average response time is under 4 hours.) Tj T* () Tj T* ET
